  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Season with salt and pepper and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Set aside to slightly cool.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64acbe7057da307c4116c801-884d4526.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot, squeezing out any excess moisture using a paper towel.\n• Finely chop garlic and long chilli (if using).\n• Thinly slice spring onion.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into rounds. Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water. TIP: Removing excess liquid from the carrot will help the fritters crisp up in the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64acbe7057da307c4116c801-f463ee92.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, whisk the egg.\n• Add carrot, spring onion, chilli, Southeast Asian spice blend, garlic, ginger paste, the plain flour and a good pinch of salt and pepper. Mix well to combine. TIP: Lift out some of the mixture with a spoon. If it's too wet and doesn't hold its shape, add a little more flour.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64acbe7057da307c4116c801-9208cd7d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of fritter mixture in batches, flattening with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don't flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. You should get 3-4 fritters per person.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Return pan to medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. TIP: Add extra oil between batches as need.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64acbe7057da307c4116c801-876e304e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the fritters are cooking, combine spinach & rocket mix, cucumber, tomatoes and sweet potato.\n• Just before serving, add crushed peanuts and Japanese style dressing. Gently toss to coat. Season salad to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64acbe7057da307c4116c801-9696ad05.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the carrot and ginger fritters between plates and serve with the salad.\n• Top the fritters with haloumi and coconut sweet chilli mayonnaise to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64acbe7057da307c4116c801-dd705f1f.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
